{"beat": 45, "name": "WHEN THE CARD CHANGES", "text": "And do it again every time the card changes. The 1913 card changed on August 15, 1913, and again on January 1, 1914. Today's cards change on a calendar: the fulfilment fee has a non-peak card and a peak card, and the postal rates move when a notice says they move. A product that sat safely under a line last year can sit over it this year without anything about the product changing. The line moved.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.22}, {"word": "do", "start": 0.22, "end": 0.36}, {"word": "it", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.46}, {"word": "again", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.74}, {"word": "every", "start": 0.74, "end": 1.2}, {"word": "time", "start": 1.2, "end": 1.6}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.6, "end": 1.8}, {"word": "card", "start": 1.8, "end": 2.06}, {"word": "changes.", "start": 2.06, "end": 2.6}, {"word": "The", "start": 3.28, "end": 3.5}, {"word": "1913", "start": 3.5, "end": 4.44}, {"word": "card", "start": 4.44, "end": 5.04}, {"word": "changed", "start": 5.04, "end": 5.68}, {"word": "on", "start": 5.68, "end": 5.94}, {"word": "August", "start": 5.94, "end": 6.3}, {"word": "15,", "start": 6.3, "end": 6.82}, {"word": "1913,", "start": 7.38, "end": 8.36}, {"word": "and", "start": 9.12, "end": 9.26}, {"word": "again", "start": 9.26, "end": 9.64}, {"word": "on", "start": 9.64, "end": 9.94}, {"word": "January", "start": 9.94, "end": 10.38}, {"word": "1,", "start": 10.38, "end": 10.88}, {"word": "1914.", "start": 11.36, "end": 12.18}, {"word": "Today's", "start": 13.14, "end": 13.56}, {"word": "cards", "start": 13.56, "end": 13.9}, {"word": "change", "start": 13.9, "end": 14.36}, {"word": "on", "start": 14.36, "end": 14.56}, {"word": "a", "start": 14.56, "end": 14.66}, {"word": "calendar:", "start": 14.66, "end": 15.08}, {"word": "the", "start": 15.68, "end": 15.8}, {"word": "fulfilment", "start": 15.8, "end": 16.24}, {"word": "fee", "start": 16.24, "end": 16.7}, {"word": "has",